## CQ-HH-104
@group client
@commands in a client: hold a pitchfork, hold right mouse (charge); hold a cleaver and charge; sneak-use a chicken with shears; throw a cleaver
@pass LOOK: charging slows the walk like a trident (J11, upstream's compensation not ported); 3D pitchfork in hand and in flight, flat in the inventory slot; cleaver has its thrown model; the swing shows no tracker desync
@fails `PitchforkItemRenderer`, `ThrownPitchforkModel`, `HHEntities` renderers in `HHClient`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> fill 0 100 0 10 100 10 minecraft:stone
> fill 0 101 0 10 104 10 minecraft:air
> gamemode survival
> clear @s
> item replace entity @s hotbar.0 with hearthandharvest:pitchfork
> item replace entity @s hotbar.1 with hearthandharvest:iron_cleaver
do {"look": {"from": "2.5 101 2.5", "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0}}
do {"slot": 0}
shot pitchfork_in_hand
do {"walk": 20, "keys": "forward"}
do {"walk": 20, "keys": "forward use", "after": 2}
shot pitchfork_charging
do {"look": {"from": "2.5 101 2.5", "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0}}
do {"slot": 1}
do {"walk": 20, "keys": "use", "after": 1}
shot cleaver_thrown
do {"screen": "inventory"}
shot inventory_slots
do {"screen": "close"}
look the two walk end lines: the forward+use walk (charging) has a lower bpt than the plain forward walk (trident-like slowdown, J11); shots: 3D pitchfork in hand and in flight, flat in the inventory slot, cleaver in flight with its thrown model, no swing desync. Sneak-use a chicken with shears stays a hand check
