## SQ-HH-328 | corn maze locate from spawn within the shipped 120 s deadline (seed 8675309), then the maze census
@phase worldgen
@group B
@commands Rewritten 2026-11-14 (corn maze weight 850, 2x; plan_bugfix_1114.md 6.3, TODO `locate #6`): three fresh group B worlds (seed 8675309 and two others, recorded), shipped `searchTimeoutSeconds` 120; in each, from spawn, `/locate structure hearthandharvest:corn_maze`, record the locate time and the candidates count from the log; then on the first found maze capture M; if not found, `execute positioned 2144 70 -2592 run locate structure hearthandharvest:corn_maze` capture M; `forceload add {M1-32} {M3-32} {M1+31} {M3+31}` (16 chunks, box centred on M); wait for load; `/cdevtest under {M1} {M3} 2 corn_maze`; `/zhh2 countset {M1-20} 50 {M3-20} {M1+20} 110 {M3+20} corn_delight:corn_crop,minecraft:oak_fence,minecraft:chest`; `/zhh2 chests {M1-20} 50 {M3-20} {M1+20} 110 {M3+20}` (box centred on M: the locate point is the maze centre; r1115 found the old M-2..M+36 box covers one quadrant, fence 8)
@pass `locate` finds a maze within 120 s from spawn on at least two of the three seeds (time and candidates recorded per seed; r1114 at weight 400 needed 424 s and 1681 candidates; if fewer than two, the owner picks a longer deadline or a higher rate); estimate group `remote` about 1 per 52x52 chunks of plains (`structure_group_estimates.md`); `corn_crop` above 100, `oak_fence: 16`, a chest with table `hearthandharvest:chests/corn_maze_center`; `under` reports no large air gaps under the built base (`over6=0`). HNH-22 maze half; the Lilliput Lane half is not built (J43, needs a substitution table), no row
@fails `structure_groups.json` `remote`, `structure_tags.json`, `has_structure/corn_maze`, framework group build; a dead locate (`NamedSet...[[]]`) is the tag
@from batches/r1115/p1_b1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> locate structure hearthandharvest:corn_maze
waitlog (?:The nearest hearthandharvest:corn_maze is at|Could not find) 200
shell grep -E "\[locate\].*corn_maze" logs/latest.log | tail -2 | cut -c1-260
capture M The nearest hearthandharvest:corn_maze is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {M1-16} {M3-16} {M1+47} {M3+47}
sleep 90
> cdevtest under {M1} {M3} 2 corn_maze
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=under (.* )?done=[01] 120
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=under id=hearthandharvest:corn_maze 
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=under .*done=0
> zhh2 countset {M1-2} 50 {M3-2} {M1+36} 110 {M3+36} corn_delight:corn_crop,minecraft:oak_fence,minecraft:chest,lootr:lootr_chest
> zhh2 chests {M1-2} 50 {M3-2} {M1+36} 110 {M3+36}
