## SQ-HH-401 | `bootexpect Done \(`; `bootreject (?i)(error|exception).*(hearthandhar
@group A
@commands **Own row: first boot with `hearthandharvest:crow`, the Hearth and Harvest crow that replaced Alex's Mobs' crow (the Alex's Mobs mixin is gone; the crash-free boot itself is SQ-HCS-01).** Before boot: `cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/hh_crow_probe.js OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_hh_crow_probe.js`, `cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zact_probe.js OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zact_probe.js` (zq_probe is copied by prep_srv.sh). This boot is "Boot D": `config/hearthandharvest-common.toml` as shipped. Commands in this section are console lines (no leading slash); `sleep`, `waitlog`, `expect`, `reject`, `count`, `capture`, `shell` are qrun directives; every row's fixture is its own x so rows are independent. Crows never spawn naturally outside nests, so every row summons its crows.; `forceload add 12000 0 12016 16`; `sleep 3`; `zhh3 spawn crow 1 12005 -60 5 noai`; `sleep 1`; `zhh3 log crow 12005 -60 5 3`; `zhh3 target 12005 -60 5 3 corn_delight:corn`; `zhh3 target 12005 -60 5 3 corn_delight:corn_seeds`; `zhh3 target 12005 -60 5 3 minecraft:wheat_seeds`; `zhh3 target 12005 -60 5 3 minecraft:dirt`
@pass `bootexpect Done \(`; `bootreject (?i)(error\|exception).*(hearthandharvest:crow\|CrowEntity\|hearthandharvest\.ce\.mixins)`; `bootreject MixinApplyError\|InvalidInjectionException\|MixinTransformerError`; `expect \[zhh3\] log hearthandharvest:crow pos=12005\.0,-60\.0,5\.0 .*tame=false .*trust=0 alarm=0`; `expect \[zhh3\] isFood corn_delight:corn true wild=true`; `expect \[zhh3\] isFood corn_delight:corn_seeds true wild=true`; `expect \[zhh3\] isFood minecraft:wheat_seeds true`; `expect \[zhh3\] isFood minecraft:dirt false`; `reject \[zhh3\] error:`
@fails `HHEntities.CROW` and `CrowEntity` (registration, `createAttributes` in the attribute event), `CrowEntity.isFood` (`#creativedelight:crow_food`). `log count=0` means the entity id or the probe's `crow` default is wrong; a probe `error:` naming `getWariness` or `isFood` means the jar predates the swap.
