## SQ-HH-482 | rerun: cow at 21 is pulled back inside 20 and licks; cow at 24 is not seen
@group A
@commands Boot F. HNH-51, J58: a cow beyond the radius (21 blocks, search reaches 22) is pulled back inside 20; a cow at 24 is not seen.; `forceload add 16830 -6 16890 6`; `sleep 3`; `fill 16830 -61 -6 16890 -56 6 minecraft:glass hollow`; `pbot spawn b482 16831 -60 -5 minecraft:overworld creative`; `sleep 2`; `setblock 16860 -60 0 salt:salt_block`; `summon minecraft:cow 16881 -60 0`; `summon minecraft:cow 16836 -60 0`; `sleep 1`; `zhh3 watch minecraft:cow 16881 -60 0 3 40 20 a 16860.5,-59.5,0.5`; `zhh3 watch minecraft:cow 16836 -60 0 3 40 20 b 16860.5,-59.5,0.5`; `waitlog \[zhh3\] watch b done 60`; `zhh3 seen a StayNearSaltGoal`; `zhh3 seen b StayNearSaltGoal`; `zhh3 assert a lastD <= 20.5`; `pbot remove b482`; `forceload remove 16830 -6 16890 6`
@pass `expect \[zhh3\] seen a StayNearSaltGoal yes`; `expect \[zhh3\] seen b StayNearSaltGoal no` (holds only while cow b stays at 24: a cow that strolls to 22 is inside the search radius and is pulled in, as in r1115); `expect \[zhh3\] assert a lastD=.* <= 20.5\.?0* PASS`
@fails `StayNearSaltGoal.beyondRadius` and `findSalt` (`saltAnimalRadius` + 2). Note a cow left inside 17 to 20 blocks without being pulled may also never lick: `findTrip` needs a complete path and a cow's follow range is 16 (retries every 125 ticks).
