## CQ-HH-601
@group client
@commands Pick-block on the bush; open Farmer's Delight tab; walk through the bush; each watering can tier in the Tools tab and JEI; WTHIT on the bush
@pass LOOK: pick gives pips, both in the FD tab (HNH-34); movement slowed (HNH-35); tier names, "Area: NxN" and capacity tooltips and JEI pages match (HNH-38); soil looks soaked (HNH-31, -32)
@fails `RaspberryBushBlock`, `HHJeiPlugin`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# setup: client through run_captures.py serve (creative superflat); every position is relative to the player (~), so a row runs wherever the last one left the player
do {"tooltip_text": "hearthandharvest:watering_can", "reject": "\\w+\\.hearthandharvest\\."}
do {"tooltip_text": "hearthandharvest:netherite_watering_can", "expect": "Area"}
do {"screen": "creative:farmersdelight.farmersdelight"}
shot fd_tab
do {"screen": "close"}
> fill ~-1 ~-1 ~1 ~10 ~-1 ~7 minecraft:grass_block
> fill ~-1 ~ ~1 ~10 ~3 ~7 minecraft:air
> setblock ~ ~ ~2 hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush[age=3]
do {"look": {"yaw": 0, "pitch": 35}}
do {"target": true, "expect": "block hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush"}
shot bush_wthit
look FD tab holds the pips and the cans (HNH-34); can tier names, "Area: NxN" and capacity tooltips and JEI pages match (HNH-38); WTHIT on the bush. Walking through the bush (HNH-35) and the soaked soil look (HNH-31, -32) are for the owner playtest

