## SQ-SPD-01 | pouch x30 wheat facing air (east) over a 5x5 farmland layer: 24 or 25 wheat, itemCount 5 or 6
@group A
@commands `/fill X-2 -61 Z-2 X+2 -61 Z+2 minecraft:farmland` (Z centre 2 blocks in front of a dispenser at -60 facing it horizontally, front block air); dispenser holds `quark:seed_pouch` `{storedItem:{id:"minecraft:wheat_seeds",Count:1b},itemCount:30}`; redstone pulse
@pass 24 `minecraft:wheat` at -60 over the 5x5 centered on the front block (the sideways dispenser stands in its own 5x5, so one cell is the dispenser); `itemCount` 6; pouch still in slot 0; no `Exception` in the log
