@pass use CONSUME; the stick stays in the main hand; no `supplementaries:stick` block on or near the basin; basin still 1 beef; two beef plus cabbage still make a skewer (SQ-BBQW-02)
@fails `StorageBlock.use` tool branch must not return PASS (PASS lets the item's own use place the stick)
@jars creativedelight
@from batches/r1115/p6_a1.qb
